{title: 084 - God the Omnipotent}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #084 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 84}
{meta: category God the Father - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F#m]God [G]the Omnipotent! [D/A]King, [G]who [A]ordainest
[G]Great [A/E]winds Thy [F#m]clarions, the lightnings [Fm]Thy [F#m]sword;
[Em]Show [D/A]forth [A]Thy [D/A]pity [D#m/A#]on [Bm]high [G]where [Bm/F#]Thou [F#/C#]reignest,
[D/A]Give [A]to [G]us [F#m]peace, O [B7]most [Em/B]merciful Lord.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F#m]God [G]the all [F#m]merciful! [D/A]earth [G]hath [A]forsaken
[G]Thy [A/E]precepts [F#m]holy, and slighted [Fm]Thy [F#m]word;
[Em]Bid [D/A]not [A]Thy [D/A]wrath in [D#m/A#]its [Bm]terrors awaken;
[D/A]Give [A]to [G]us [F#m]peace, O [B7]most [Em/B]merciful Lord.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F#m]God [G]the all [F#m]righteousness [D/A]One! [G]man [A]hath [G]defied [F#m]Thee;
[G]Yet [A/E]to eternity [F#m]standeth [Fm]Thy [F#m]word;
[Em]Falsehood [D/A]and wrong [D#m/A#]shall [Bm]not [G]tarry [F#/C#]beside [F#m/C#]Thee;
[D/A]Prosper [G]the [F#m]right, O [B7]most [Em/B]merciful Lord.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F#m]So [G]shall we [F#m]render [D/F#]Thee thankful [A]devotion,
[G]For Thy [A/E]deliverance [F#m]from peril [Fm]and [F#m]sword,
[Em]Singing [A]in [D/A]chorus [D#m/A#]from [Bm]ocean to [F#/C#]ocean,
[D/A]"Thine [A]is [G]the [F#m]power [B7]and [Em/B]the [D/A]glory, [Em/G]O [D/F#]Lord."
{end_of_verse}
